  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on building competence in the field of emergency medicine and rehabilitation. In this one-year project, such capacity building is achieved through digital cooperation and networking activities. The aim is to develop a digital cooperation that will have a positive effect on the partnership also when physical exchange is again possible. South Africa and Malawi</narrative>
  </description>
